# Windsurf rules for Video2Text
# Windsurf reads this file automatically. The full universal guide is in AGENTS.md.

# Project: Video2Text — offline video transcription (Bilibili / Douyin / local).
# Stack: Python 3.8+. Core lib in `video2text/`, batch lib in `douyin_batch/`.
# CLI: `python douyin_batch_v3.py --user <URL> --lang en`.

# Conventions
# - `pathlib.Path` everywhere.
# - All user-visible strings via `t()` from `douyin_batch/i18n.py`.
#   Add new keys to `Messages` as `{"en": "...", "zh": "..."}`.
# - PEP 604 / PEP 585 syntax requires `from __future__ import annotations`.
# - Type hints on public functions. English docstrings.

# Build
# - `make test` → `python run_tests.py` (38 tests must pass)
# - `make lint` → flake8 + black --check
# - `make format` → black + isort

# Hard rules
# - Never commit `output/`, `models/`, `*.cookies`, `.env`.
# - Never add new deps without updating `pyproject.toml` + `requirements.txt`.
# - Use `douyin_batch.security.is_safe_url()` for URL validation.
# - Use `douyin_batch.platform_compat.safe_filename()` for filenames.

